  "instructions": "BATTER: Mix dry ingredients together. Then add warm plant-based milk and water slowly and keep mixing all the ingredients. If needed, add some more plant-based milk or water. Optionally add some ground or chopped nuts or seeds. Then add 1 tsp lemon juice or vinegar.\nBAKE: Transfer batter to a baking container lined with parchment paper. Sprinkle some sesame seeds on top. Bake for 20 to 25 minutes at 180 C in a preheated oven or an air fryer.",
